config FATX_FS
	tristate "Xbox FATX filesystem support"
	depends on BLOCK
	select BUFFER_HEAD
	help
	  Minimal support for the original Xbox FATX filesystem.

	  This is intended for bootstrapping Linux from files copied to the
	  Xbox E: partition, such as a loop-mounted ext2 root image.  The
	  write path can overwrite data inside existing files, but it cannot
	  create, delete, rename, extend, or allocate FATX files.
